                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'What it shows: the sources of revenue, starting from location type. How to read it: click a bar and drill down to see which regions and cities drive it. Compare the shares with the scatter to see whether big revenue sources are profitable. Basis: monthly profit table. Caution: in your data City-Centre stores generate about half of revenue, and Train-Station is only 2 stores. At city level 36 of 48 cities have one store and the rest have two, so city bars are close to single-store results. This visual shows revenue only, not profit.'"
